Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:05.16,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}With supplies being limited,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:09.09,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}we'll need to add a rule allowing\Npassage in and out of the Colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.70,0:00:11.80,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I can't afford to \Nlet Players like Dhruv,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.25,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}who attack people indiscriminately,\Nto leave the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.54,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that will have to come after
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.54,0:00:21.43,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}eliminating all Players like him \Nfrom the other Colonies, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.43,0:00:23.68,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}So communication between\NColonies is a necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.37,0:00:26.67,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}So there are the two rules\NFushiguro{**-kun} proposed:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.67,0:00:29.30,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}a means of communication,\Nand passage in and out of the Colonies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:33.05,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}That means we'll need four additional\Nrules to get this situation under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.62,0:00:35.59,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everyone's worn out from Shibuya, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.59,0:00:37.82,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}They're at their limit,\Nphysically and emotionally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.39,0:00:40.75,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}{*}Teach{*Sensei}...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.56,0:00:44.93,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I won't let you kill\Nyour best friend twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:47.54,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll be the one to kill Kenjaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.90,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll obtain 400 points on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.67,0:00:59.01,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,It's okay to come out now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.01,0:01:02.61,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Let's continue making our way\Nnorth to the edge of the barrier.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.61,0:01:04.43,Default,Daughter,0,0,0,,Carry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.43,0:01:05.49,Default,Mother,0,0,0,,Hang in there, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.34,0:01:08.30,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Let's take a short break.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.30,0:01:12.68,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,This stadium was controlled by the\Npowerful sorcerer I just defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.68,0:01:16.25,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,People will be hesitant to\Napproach it for a while yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.25,0:01:16.52,Default,Oldman,0,0,0,,What's that sound?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.91,0:01:23.26,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Run into the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.62,0:01:26.52,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.91,0:01:35.07,Default,Man,0,0,0,,H-Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.55,0:01:43.04,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are these cockroaches real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.93,0:01:45.54,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.01,0:01:53.51,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Rika! Knock it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.51,0:01:54.45,Default,Man,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:57.04,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.70,0:02:13.02,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Kogane, is that a Player?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.14,0:02:16.86,Default,Kogane,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's called Kurourushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.94,0:02:20.39,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,So some Players are cursed spirits, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.86,0:02:49.15,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm being watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:53.11,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Likely by the other two\NPlayers with high points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.11,0:02:55.53,Default,Kurourushi,0,0,0,,Why do you interfere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.53,0:02:57.31,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Kurourushi is a cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.68,0:03:00.77,Default,Kurourushi,0,0,0,,Why do you kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.77,0:03:02.28,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can exorcise it for certain
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:07.20,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}if I drive positive energy from my\Nreverse cursed technique into its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.85,0:03:09.79,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,That's what I'd like to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.25,0:03:11.09,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:14.77,Default,Kurourushi,0,0,0,,I like the taste of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.89,0:03:22.55,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't want those other two to know\NI can use the reverse cursed technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.55,0:03:25.29,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Rika is protecting\Neveryone in the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.29,0:03:29.02,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to exorcise Kurourushi without\Nusing Rika or my reverse cursed technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.36,0:03:39.02,Default,Kurourushi,0,0,0,,Blinding, blinding, blinding...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.78,0:04:54.34,Default,Kogane,0,0,0,,You have earned five points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.34,0:04:56.31,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,I see you can use...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:58.44,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,reverse cursed technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.04,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.04,0:05:08.79,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,A strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.11,0:05:20.76,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}My arm is back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:22.12,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing's off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:25.17,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her technique probably manipulates space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:28.41,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I guess it can't crush her\Nopponent along with said space.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.41,0:05:31.89,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}It feels like it's creating errors similar\Nto the distortions from a lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.19,0:05:36.52,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,My technique treats the\N"sky" as a "surface."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:39.71,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:42.11,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's revealing her technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:44.81,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hurry up and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.39,0:05:47.75,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I'll go ahead and ask...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:50.39,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,You're someone who won't complain \Nabout getting killed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.39,0:05:53.59,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I can understand powerless people\Ngetting desperate for points,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.59,0:05:57.43,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,but a strong person like you can\Nclaim points whenever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.43,0:06:00.25,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,So what's your reason for\Nactively seeking a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:01.87,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}This little...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.29,0:06:06.80,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,What, are sorcerers of this age\Nthat casual about incarnation?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:10.30,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,To us, this means coming\Nback from the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:13.29,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,People who lived out\Ntheir lives without regrets
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:15.72,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,wouldn't accept Kenjaku's\Noffer, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.86,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}He pisses me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.23,0:06:22.37,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,The Culling Game is just the first step\Ntoward a chance at a second life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:25.98,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Keep in mind, Kenjaku \Nset the stage for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.98,0:06:29.55,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,We should be earning points to prepare\Nfor anything that could happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.22,0:06:32.94,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Do you not have any friends or lovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.07,0:06:35.98,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:40.28,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I didn't have any friends\Nuntil recently either,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.28,0:06:42.22,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,but I can't empathize with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.65,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah. This feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:47.41,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's like he's tracing my trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:49.84,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Even if you had regrets,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.47,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,you're killing people hundreds—\Nthousands—of years removed from then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.84,0:06:55.96,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,How can you be so desperate\Nfor your own sake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:07:00.23,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Are you... one of the Fujiwara?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.72,0:07:04.27,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,What would anyone from your\Nbloodline understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.34,0:07:15.86,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Granite Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.59,0:07:27.04,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ishigori?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.06,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}That rooftop?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.06,0:07:31.05,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's rather close.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.29,0:07:34.93,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even with Rika protecting\Nthe people in the stadium,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:38.53,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}a direct hit from an attack on that\Nlevel would cause several to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.53,0:07:39.81,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}So first, I'll take Ishigori...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.37,0:07:45.22,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that Kurourushi and Dhruv are gone,\NI have no reason to let Ishigori run free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:47.47,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll take both him and Okkotsu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:48.52,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}...out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.47,0:07:48.52,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}...out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.33,0:07:52.49,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Granite Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.12,0:08:08.38,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Come on, don't disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:11.53,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,He's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.53,0:08:14.77,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Right! That's where Okkotsu \Ndug a hole earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.21,0:08:21.86,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Please fight a little more discreetly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.86,0:08:25.94,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Will that sate the hunger, Okkotsu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.16,0:08:33.11,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Would you tell a kid with\Na feast before him
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.11,0:08:36.06,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,to slow down and take his time eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.41,0:08:39.30,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Wouldn't anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.09,0:08:43.15,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Right. Most probably would.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.15,0:08:44.74,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That was a bad example.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.28,0:08:49.30,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,My first run at life was\Nmoderately filling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.93,0:08:52.38,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I fought some guys with real backbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.38,0:08:54.48,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I met a nice woman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.96,0:08:59.23,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Frankly, it would be hard\Nto say I had any regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:05.94,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,This vague hunger is the most\Nannoying kind, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.94,0:09:07.13,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Everyone looks at me with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:09.46,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,"What are you unsatisfied about?"\Non their face.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:15.41,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Did you know these cigarettes have\Na slightly sweet aftertaste?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.99,0:09:21.21,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,There was no dessert in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:23.21,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Here it comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.45,0:09:33.67,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why am I unsatisfied?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.47,0:09:36.37,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:46.73,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm unsatisfied because\NI'm not fulfilled!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:03.50,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You'd better not be crushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.75,0:10:05.88,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:21.06,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.43,0:10:39.06,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:48.17,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Not calling your shikigami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.69,0:10:51.09,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.69,0:10:53.67,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Not with you going wild.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.89,0:10:55.85,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.74,0:11:00.97,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's probably trying to limit my paths,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.15,0:11:03.73,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I'll break through...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.94,0:11:06.19,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}head-on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.35,0:11:08.68,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.68,0:11:10.36,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That's it, Okkotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:11.64,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.32,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}His cursed energy is more precise!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.32,0:11:17.10,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.29,0:11:24.46,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Well done! Here's a reward!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.55,0:11:30.03,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.03,0:11:32.09,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I overheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:42.48,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You're good, Okkotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:46.35,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Are you my dessert?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:56.87,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You are the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.49,0:12:03.36,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}What I strike isn't the person,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.71,0:12:05.50,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}but the surface of the "sky."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:08.96,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Thin Ice Breaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:15.04,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Out of our way, you pile of vomit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.62,0:12:20.39,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Can it, dick cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.69,0:12:28.50,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,You're resilient.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.50,0:12:29.67,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.67,0:12:32.06,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,I decided to torment you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.64,0:12:35.04,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That packed a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.04,0:12:38.28,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That's my first time\Neating my own technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:41.37,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Reverse cursed technique\Nis a pain to deal with,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.66,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}but it burns cursed energy like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.93,0:12:49.86,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,We're finally seeing the bottom\Nof your reserves, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.23,0:12:52.87,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,No matter how delicious\Nor high-end the shop is,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:55.02,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,seeing the displays empty\Nclose to closing time
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:56.72,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,is always disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.09,0:12:59.98,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I guess it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.75,0:13:10.00,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}I wanted to gain more distance\Nfrom everyone in the stadium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.00,0:13:11.27,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.34,0:13:18.18,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Come here, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:20.40,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Give me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:26.02,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}His shikigami completely manifested?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.77,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}How does that work?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:30.39,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's swelling with\Ncursed energy again, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.89,0:13:33.92,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Yuta, which would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:35.48,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.70,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I'll take that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.81,0:13:41.70,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,"Rika" is the stockpile of cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.70,0:13:43.79,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,and the externalization\Nof Okkotsu's technique
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.79,0:13:46.56,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,that remained with him after\NRika Orimoto passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:49.38,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,While connected to "Rika" \Nthrough the ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.38,0:13:51.97,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,he gains the following:\Nuse of his cursed technique,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.97,0:13:53.65,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,the complete manifestation of "Rika,"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.65,0:13:56.98,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,and cursed energy supplied by "Rika."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.07,0:14:02.12,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,He can remain connected for five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.26,0:14:05.31,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.90,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:09.22,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't underestimate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.91,0:14:15.25,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:17.11,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Snake eyes and fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.60,0:14:18.70,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.91,0:14:25.43,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.43,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You're super sweet, aren't you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.77,0:14:30.81,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Rika!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:31.35,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:32.31,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:34.68,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.28,0:14:41.77,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:45.35,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Don't act like you've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:17.34,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.34,0:15:19.39,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,I won't forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.82,0:15:31.04,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:32.98,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.62,0:15:36.40,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.27,0:15:39.12,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even with this, I can't fully block it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.39,0:15:43.55,Default,Ishigo,0,0,0,,Want a go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.68,0:16:14.08,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Thin Ice Breaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.57,0:16:24.42,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Tsk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.97,0:16:34.71,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Fujiwara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.47,0:16:39.16,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I've still got a strong appetite!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.67,0:16:42.52,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Let's keep chowing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.26,0:16:45.88,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,It's always you, Fujiwara!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.21,0:16:48.52,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,You always get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.52,0:16:50.65,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Are you that afraid of me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.65,0:16:53.41,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Afraid of me becoming my own person?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.41,0:17:02.99,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Okkotsu had defeated Dhruv Lakdawalla,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.49,0:17:07.67,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,whose technique made the path of\Nhis shikigami into his domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.67,0:17:10.98,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,which cut into anything it touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.63,0:17:16.66,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is... Dhruv's technique!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:20.26,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is Okkotsu's technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:21.35,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Copy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.12,0:17:38.02,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I don't know what my\Nancestors did to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.02,0:17:42.42,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,but you'll eventually reach your limit\Nif you live solely for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.79,0:17:43.67,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.67,0:17:46.01,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,"Live for the sake of others!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.01,0:17:48.29,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,"There's no need to be your own person!"
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:54.93,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,It's always the ones who already became\Nsomeone who bark things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.47,0:18:12.14,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Quit your annoying whining!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.14,0:18:13.81,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,At this point...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:17.62,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,words are unnecessary!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.50,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.50,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.75,0:18:24.50,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.83,0:18:29.96,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Give me back Yuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:32.84,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Even if it tries to penetrate\Nthe barrier later...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.03,0:18:34.84,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I'm not going to drag this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.84,0:18:37.29,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Let's settle this nice and sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.17,0:18:43.46,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,At that moment, the black\Ndevil of the modern age...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:47.34,Default,Kurourushi,0,0,0,,I like the taste of iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.34,0:18:49.39,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,...flew into the barriers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.39,0:18:57.78,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Kurourushi had completed parthenogenesis\Nbefore going dormant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:02.60,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,So Kurourushi was still alive\Nand well as a cursed spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:06.91,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,The complex forces of three domains\Nhad been keeping them all in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.80,0:19:11.14,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,But this intruder was unexpected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.93,0:19:13.50,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,And so the barriers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.16,0:19:18.00,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,collapsed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.35,0:19:24.93,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,How is Kurourushi alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.27,0:19:31.42,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.42,0:19:34.01,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't use my technique right\Nafter Domain Expansion!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.77,0:19:42.79,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,How dare you take my arm?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.79,0:19:44.34,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Fujiwara!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.34,0:19:46.72,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That's enough, Uro.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:50.29,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You two aren't invited to this table.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:54.26,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Granite Blast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:20:01.18,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Ishigori's technique is\NCursed Energy Discharge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.18,0:20:05.84,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,It's an extremely simple attack,\Nbut it performs just as well
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.84,0:20:08.56,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,even when his technique is burnt out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:17.91,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:23.00,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,have a seat at our table,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.76,0:20:25.94,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.11,0:20:28.88,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Let's go, Rika.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.90,0:20:37.28,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Okkotsu can discharge a high\Nvolume of cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.28,0:20:40.76,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,only while Rika is completely manifested.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:44.92,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,However, his maximum output is\Nslightly inferior to Ishigori's.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.18,0:20:49.70,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,So he planned to charge and\Nunleash his cursed energy
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.70,0:20:52.01,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,before Ishigori reached maximum output.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:54.44,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,At first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.59,0:21:00.57,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Four hundred years of longing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:03.44,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,The intense gaze full of that hunger
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.78,0:21:07.80,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,melted Okkotsu Yuta's heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.80,0:21:11.96,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,even though he would likely\Nnever find meaning in fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.92,0:21:14.95,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.64,0:21:37.40,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That was seriously sweet, Okkotsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.97,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.97,0:21:51.28,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.86,0:21:57.14,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}That big thing can fire it on its own?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.70,0:21:58.75,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.76,0:22:01.65,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}its force is weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.16,0:22:05.91,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}After Domain Expansion\Nand a meal with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.76,0:22:11.15,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}even you couldn't have\Nrecovered that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.48,0:22:12.96,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I'll settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.38,0:22:15.75,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Granite Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.39,0:22:22.63,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okkotsu's technique
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.53,0:22:25.75,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,{\i1}had already recovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.45,0:22:30.34,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Uro's technique?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.83,0:22:33.59,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought he was more than\Njust a cursed speech user!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.59,0:22:38.40,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I figured that big thing probably had\Na different technique from Okkotsu's,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.40,0:22:39.68,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}but I was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.68,0:22:42.03,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okkotsu's technique is Copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.03,0:22:43.85,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}But there should be strenuous\Nconditions on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.85,0:22:45.80,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}When?! When did he\Nsatisfy those conditions?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:47.05,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}While I wasn't looking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.43,0:22:49.43,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Don't tell me there are no conditions?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:55.43,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was when he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.98,0:22:57.23,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Thin Ice Breaker!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.45,0:23:09.56,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.01,0:23:13.11,Default,Narration,0,0,0,,Okkotsu's connection\Nto "Rika" was severed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.54,0:23:21.72,Default,Rika,0,0,0,,Yuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.90,0:23:26.59,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I had no idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.33,0:23:33.47,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,there was more after\Nwringing everything out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.32,0:23:40.09,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is what dessert is like!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.09,0:24:03.61,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Now we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.17,0:24:08.03,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.38,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is he after?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.21,0:24:29.82,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Was this mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.64,0:24:34.04,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that instant...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.04,0:24:37.86,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,{\i1}he sent it sailing back to\Nme using Uro's technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.05,0:24:42.60,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.47,0:24:51.46,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I'm full.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.32,0:25:11.85,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You're too soft, Okkotsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.72,0:25:14.71,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I'm not praising you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.71,0:25:16.96,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Sparing the life of a sorcerer\Nwho fought to kill you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.96,0:25:19.70,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,There's nothing to gain from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.70,0:25:21.08,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Uro{**-san} told me the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.47,0:25:23.65,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,That woman's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.21,0:25:29.45,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Well, I guess my blast was weaker\Nafter my Domain Expansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:32.54,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,She kept going on about something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.54,0:25:33.75,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Were you having a lover's spat?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.25,0:25:35.79,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.35,0:25:38.35,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Don't look so annoyed by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:41.28,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can say to that woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.23,0:25:44.84,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Anything I say will lead to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.42,0:25:47.62,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Because I'm blessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.79,0:25:50.48,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Is that how it works?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.48,0:25:52.42,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.66,0:25:55.23,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,Regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.69,0:25:57.26,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,please give me your points.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.27,0:26:02.12,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.12,0:26:05.18,Default,Ishigori,0,0,0,,You would have killed us\Nif not for this, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.96,0:26:09.10,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.58,Default,Okkotsu,0,0,0,,You should be grateful to my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.03,0:26:29.11,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,You're the one who will\Nreach their limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.66,0:26:34.61,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,I've seen it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.21,0:26:40.13,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,Be it sorcerer or cursed spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.35,0:26:43.36,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,those who surpass the\Nbounds of being strong
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.61,0:26:46.87,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,all have overwhelming egos.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.21,0:26:48.87,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,They don't concern themselves\Nwith other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.40,0:26:50.62,Default,Uro,0,0,0,,They're calamities.
